  "description": "Engineered for adult riders who crave adrenaline, the RT X is a true performance beast that redefines off-road playability. It’s not just a ride; it’s your ultimate ticket to tear up the dirt and conquer the wild.\n\nPowered by a formidable 6500W peak motor and delivering 300NM of torque, this machine offers thrilling raw power. Experience the rush with a top speed of 53 mph, effortlessly dominating steep inclines and rugged landscapes. Feed your adventurous spirit with a massive 72V 30Ah battery, providing an impressive range of up to 70 miles on a single charge.\n\nEquipped with aggressive 19x3.0'' front and 17x3.0'' rear off-road tires, the RT X ensures maximum traction and agility on any terrain.\n\nWith a robust 160mm travel hydraulic front fork and a high-performance rear shock absorber, this suspension system effortlessly absorbs punishing impacts while keeping your wheels firmly planted. It’s engineered for absolute steering precision and smooth handling, allowing you to conquer unpredictable trails and push your off-road limits with total confidence.",
